  "_about": "St Isaac's: walls of light grey Ruskeala marble, the podium and steps grey granite, the portico and colonnade columns red granite, the domes gilded, the roofs grey sheet metal, the statues and pediment reliefs dark bronze. Inside: white Italian marble walls, pink and cherry marble columns, floors of grey Ruskeala with pink and cherry, gilded and painted vaults, the dome painted, the iconostasis in gilt and mosaic icons, malachite and lapis columns, the stained-glass Resurrection in the apse window.",
